[00:09.02]1. A paradise our God has promised,
[00:18.05]By means of Christ’s Millennial Reign,
[00:27.08]When he’ll blot out all sin and error,
[00:33.58]Removing death and tears and pain.
[00:36.81](Chorus)
[00:40.05]A paradise, the earth will be.
[00:43.29]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[00:51.77]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[00:59.27]For he delights to do God’s will.
[01:10.94]2. Soon here on earth, as God has purposed,
[01:17.44]His Son will cause the dead to rise.
[01:23.94]Then it will be as Jesus promised:
[01:27.08]‘You’ll be with me in Paradise.’
[01:30.22](Chorus)
[01:33.36]A paradise, the earth will be.
[01:43.36]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[01:48.36]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[01:55.87]For he delights to do God’s will.
[02:18.91]3. The Paradise, our Lord has promised,
[02:22.91]And he is now our reigning King.
[02:28.89]We daily thank our loving Father,
[02:35.61]And from our hearts, his praises sing.
[02:38.40](Chorus)
[02:43.28]A paradise, the earth will be.
[02:48.16]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[02:53.44]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[03:21.24]For he delights to do God’s will.